        "start_codepoint": 0,
        "end_codepoint": 15,
        "source_quote": "穎川周昭著書稱歩騭及嚴畯等曰：",
        "reading": "敘者標明周昭著論，論及步騭、嚴畯等人。"
      },
      {
        "id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line116:reading-000-124",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line116",
        "person_id": "5sl_p6s_iab",
        "related_person_ids": [],
        "start_codepoint": 0,
        "end_codepoint": 124,
        "source_quote": "古今賢士大夫所以失名喪身傾家害國者，其由非一也，然要其大歸，總其常患，四者而已。急論議一也，爭名勢二也，重朋黨三也，務欲速四也。急論議則傷人，爭名勢則敗友，重朋黨則蔽主，務欲速則失德，此四者不除，未有能全也。當世君子能不然者，亦比有之，豈獨古人乎！",
        "reading": "周昭先列損人、敗友、蔽主、失德之四患。"
      },
      {
        "id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line116:reading-124-157",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line116",
        "person_id": "5sl_p6s_iab",
        "related_person_ids": [
          "syc_ik6_bq5_**AA",
          "lpo_z63_vzb",
          "snv_2iq_jes",
          "szg_rhg_18d",
          "roi_rz4_ute_B"
        ],
        "start_codepoint": 124,
        "end_codepoint": 157,
        "source_quote": "然論其絶異，未若顧豫章、諸葛使君、歩丞相、嚴衞尉、張奮威之爲美也。",
        "reading": "列五人官稱，張奮威指任奮威將軍的張承。"
      },
      {
        "id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line116:reading-157-254",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line116",
        "person_id": "5sl_p6s_iab",
        "related_person_ids": [
          "syc_ik6_bq5_**AA",
          "lpo_z63_vzb",
          "snv_2iq_jes",
          "szg_rhg_18d",
          "roi_rz4_ute_B",
          "fp6_ia6_7yw"
        ],
        "start_codepoint": 157,
        "end_codepoint": 254,
        "source_quote": "《論語》言『夫子恂恂然善誘人』，又曰『成人之美，不成人之惡』，豫章有之矣。『望之儼然，即之也溫，聽其言也厲』，使君體之矣。『恭而安，威而不猛』，丞相履之矣。學不求祿，心無苟得，衞尉，奮威蹈之矣。",
        "reading": "取《論語》及儒者行誼，分舉顧邵、諸葛瑾、步騭、嚴畯、張承。"
      },
      {
        "id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line116:reading-254-287",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line116",
        "person_id": "5sl_p6s_iab",
        "related_person_ids": [
          "syc_ik6_bq5_**AA",
          "lpo_z63_vzb",
          "snv_2iq_jes",
          "szg_rhg_18d",
          "roi_rz4_ute_B"
        ],
        "start_codepoint": 254,
        "end_codepoint": 287,
        "source_quote": "此五君者，雖德實有差，輕重不同，至於趣捨大檢，不犯四者，懼一揆也。",
        "reading": "五君德實有差，論者以其同不犯四患。"
      },
      {
        "id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line116:reading-287-328",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line116",
        "person_id": "syc_ik6_bq5_**AA",
        "related_person_ids": [
          "esa_6ie_bng",
          "pax_gtm_aew"
        ],
        "start_codepoint": 287,
        "end_codepoint": 328,
        "source_quote": "昔丁諝出於孤家，吾粲由於牧堅，豫章揚其善，以並陸、全之列，是以人無幽滯而風俗厚焉。",
        "reading": "顧邵薦丁諝、吾粲。本文「陸、全」只稱姓，這兩字不能單獨決定各是哪一人。"
      },
      {
        "id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line116:reading-328-358",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line116",
        "person_id": "5sl_p6s_iab",
        "related_person_ids": [
          "lpo_z63_vzb",
          "snv_2iq_jes",
          "szg_rhg_18d"
        ],
        "start_codepoint": 328,
        "end_codepoint": 358,
        "source_quote": "使君、丞相、衞尉三君，昔以布衣俱相友善，諸論者因各敘其優劣。",
        "reading": "三君為諸葛瑾、步騭、嚴畯。"
      },
      {
        "id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line118:reading-000-075",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line118",
        "person_id": "5sl_p6s_iab",
        "related_person_ids": [
          "szg_rhg_18d",
          "snv_2iq_jes",
          "lpo_z63_vzb"
        ],
        "start_codepoint": 0,
        "end_codepoint": 75,
        "source_quote": "初，先衞尉，次丞相，而後有使君也。其後並事明主，經營世務，出處之才有不同，先後之名須反其初，此世常人所決勤薄也。至於三君分好，卒無虧損，豈非古人交哉！",
        "reading": "周昭記三人早先品次、實際任官及始終交好。"
      },
      {
        "id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line118:reading-075-135",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line118",
        "person_id": "szg_rhg_18d",
        "related_person_ids": [
          "ooa_1fr_hy9",
          "572_278_cba"
        ],
        "start_codepoint": 75,
        "end_codepoint": 135,
        "source_quote": "又魯橫江昔杖萬兵，屯據陸口，當世之美業也，能與不能，孰不願焉？而橫江既亡，衞尉應其選，自以才非將帥，深辭固讓，終於不就。",
        "reading": "魯橫江即魯肅。卷五十三同記權命嚴畯代肅，畯固辭。"
      },
      {
        "id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line118:reading-135-222",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line118",
        "person_id": "5sl_p6s_iab",
        "related_person_ids": [
          "szg_rhg_18d",
          "lpo_z63_vzb",
          "snv_2iq_jes",
          "fp6_ia6_7yw"
        ],
        "start_codepoint": 135,
        "end_codepoint": 222,
        "source_quote": "後徙九列，遷典八座，榮不足以自曜，祿不足以自奉。至於二君，皆位爲上將，窮富極貴。衞尉既無求欲，二君又不稱薦，各守所志。保其名好。孔子曰：『君子矜而不爭，群而不黨。』斯有風矣。",
        "reading": "嚴畯的職位、俸祿與另外兩君並論，又引孔子語。"
      },
      {
        "id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line118:reading-222-327",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line118",
        "person_id": "roi_rz4_ute_B",
        "related_person_ids": [
          "lpo_z63_vzb",
          "snv_2iq_jes"
        ],
        "start_codepoint": 222,
        "end_codepoint": 327,
        "source_quote": "又奮威之名，亦三君之次也，當一方之戍，受上將之任，與使君、丞相不異也。然歷國事，論功勞，實有先後；故爵位之榮殊焉。而奮威將處此，決能明其部分，心無失道之欲，事無充詘之求。每升朝堂，循禮而動，辭氣謇謇，罔不惟忠。",
        "reading": "奮威為張承，在此所比的上將為諸葛瑾與步騭。"
      },
      {
        "id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line118:reading-327-350",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line118",
        "person_id": "roi_rz4_ute_B",
        "related_person_ids": [
          "roi_rz4_ute_A",
          "512_1cd_a4b",
          "uti_8b5_tcd"
        ],
        "start_codepoint": 327,
        "end_codepoint": 350,
        "source_quote": "叔嗣雖親貴，言憂其敗，蔡文至雖疏賤，談稱其賢。",
        "reading": "殿本與固定文字均見叔嗣、蔡文至。《考證》主張叔嗣當元遜，《集解》兼載支持保留叔嗣諸說。《考證》以蔡文至為蔡款。"
      },
      {
        "id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line118:reading-350-393",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line118",
        "person_id": "roi_rz4_ute_B",
        "related_person_ids": [
          "roi_rz4_ute_BB",
          "572_278_cba_A"
        ],
        "start_codepoint": 350,
        "end_codepoint": 393,
        "source_quote": "女配太子，受禮若弔，慷愾之趨，惟篤人物，成敗得失，皆如所慮，可謂守道見機，好古之士也。",
        "reading": "承女配太子，《張承傳》及《孫和傳》互證。"
      },
      {
        "id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line118:reading-393-468",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line118",
        "person_id": "5sl_p6s_iab",
        "related_person_ids": [
          "syc_ik6_bq5_**AA",
          "lpo_z63_vzb",
          "snv_2iq_jes",
          "szg_rhg_18d",
          "roi_rz4_ute_B"
        ],
        "start_codepoint": 393,
        "end_codepoint": 468,
        "source_quote": "若乃經國家，當軍旅，於馳騖之際，立霸王之功，此五者未爲過人。至其純粹履道，求不苟得，升降當世，保全名行，邈然絶俗，實有所師。故粗論其事，以示後之君子。",
        "reading": "周昭以保全名行結論。"
      },
      {
        "id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line120:reading-000-023",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line120",
        "person_id": "5sl_p6s_iab",
        "related_person_ids": [
          "4qw_13i_jn6",
          "57a_8f8_a32",
          "idb_k2n_p9s"
        ],
        "start_codepoint": 0,
        "end_codepoint": 23,
        "source_quote": "周昭者字恭遠，與韋曜、薛瑩、華覈並述《呉書》，",
        "reading": "字恭遠及參修《吳書》。卷五十三華覈所述同修名單另具梁廣。"
      },
      {
        "id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line120:reading-023-049",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line120",
        "person_id": "5sl_p6s_iab",
        "related_person_ids": [
          "idb_k2n_p9s",
          "0fo_c5c_4yh"
        ],
        "start_codepoint": 23,
        "end_codepoint": 49,
        "source_quote": "後爲中書郎，坐事下獄，覈表救之，孫休不聽，遂伏法云。",
        "reading": "任中書郎、下獄，華覈表救，孫休不聽，周昭伏法。"
      }
    ],
